  "content": "Context: Suspension of Recovery:\n\n## Suspension of Recovery:  \nRecovery not to be made except with official's consent in cases of  \nsuspension, or on leave for ten days on HPL or LWP in a calendar month.  \nWhen advance of pay is being recovered, recovery may not be made on subscriber's written request. - Rule 13 (2).",
